ίας και ευαισθητοποίησης πάνω στα δικαιώματα των παιδιών. (από το Δίκτυο για το Θέατρο στην εκπαίδευση).</span></span><div><span><span> </span></span><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhD8ApTET9lHCyyuXcdAJpy23aIqCywBnFM5sHUwbpADaAD4ZwZejLPEuCKPrDdP6yvGQ5A1DWeojzwrpRWmbXz-rEx6DlOesQeYa8037Q-q-n-OziqQZCMzPknUSsu6cTEo23NQFwn4mtprNZWtbXZqcqkk26WwKhJgzlyW6iGgAt7XIAfQDlh5NJM/s1600/5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhD8ApTET9lHCyyuXcdAJpy23aIqCywBnFM5sHUwbpADaAD4ZwZejLPEuCKPrDdP6yvGQ5A1DWeojzwrpRWmbXz-rEx6DlOesQeYa8037Q-q-n-OziqQZCMzPknUSsu6cTEo23NQFwn4mtprNZWtbXZqcqkk26WwKhJgzlyW6iGgAt7XIAfQDlh5NJM/s320/5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></div><br /><span><br /></span><span><span>Συνεχίσαμε με το βιβλίο του Ε. Τριβιζά \"όλοι γεννιόμαστε Ελεύθεροι\".</span></span></div><div><span><span><br /></span></span></div><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnAgr74wNH_A4RfhD3wcFRPa3JbT76Yb_jzxghwMAuPwsxhaShhpdFxr2lsDmjdaVs5fsf8NAzm3GODvDosODeABOLSriL5_2lZek1N--596JQkMmCgmKdECi-T6ui3TIViC9vSu4Y7Drb4yI_HrzkfVgnItOzQqPAop-905YYK-cKhX_Ot6VyR-1F/s1600/4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnAgr74wNH_A4RfhD3wcFRPa3JbT76Yb_jzxghwMAuPwsxhaShhpdFxr2lsDmjdaVs5fsf8NAzm3GODvDosODeABOLSriL5_2lZek1N--596JQkMmCgmKdECi-T6ui3TIViC9vSu4Y7Drb4yI_HrzkfVgnItOzQqPAop-905YYK-cKhX_Ot6VyR-1F/s320/4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></a></div><br /><span><br /></span><span><span>Διακρίναμε τον πρόσφυγα από τον μετανάστη..</span></span></div><div><span><span><br /></span></span></div><div><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglLDPGgnujnewhyvLu3E-5VIkMuwEMwB09Y7o5wmL5DVJduCMDb8hRe9NYOL8WSi_37bylTOw6RSMyjtIiMjqcY_NO1zDi